{
    "_notes": "Bosch BME280 (temperature, pressure, humidity) at 0x76 (SDO low) or 0x77 (SDO high, Adafruit default). Detection: chip ID (0xD0) 0x60 - a BMP280 (0x56-0x58) or BME680 (0x61) doesn't match. Init: soft reset (0xE0B6), 5 ms; config (0xF5) standby 500 ms, filter off; ctrl_hum (0xF2) humidity x1 - written before ctrl_meas, which applies it; ctrl_meas (0xF4) temperature x1, pressure x1, normal mode. Poll: the calibration (0x88, 26 bytes; 0xE1, 7 bytes) and the data (0xF7, 8 bytes) - the decode code applies Bosch's floating-point compensation (datasheet 8.1). 0x76 is also a common multiplexer address (Axiom018's), where the BME280 can't be used.",
    "addresses": "0x76-0x77",
